      "review_description": "I had an \"awesome\" experience with Elcoda. The sales rep whom I dealt with \"Ash\"  answered all my many and varied questions.All the employees from the owner to the sparkie and installers were polite, friendly and did a wonderful job.We agreed on an install date (to fit in with my own schedule) and they contacted me the day before to check and confirm it was a go. Lucky for me no rain that day and everything was installed on the agreed day.The installation team worked like a well oiled machine and the final product is so neat and straight it is impressive.I highly recommend using Elcoda for Solar installation.",
